      "start_seconds": 171.11,
      "end_seconds": 181.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "Okay: weight 81 kilos, BMI works out to 30.5, heart rate 75. And height 163 centimetres, BP is 108 over 79."
