      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.11,
      "end_seconds": 305.03,
      "duration_seconds": 14.92,
      "text": "Use condoms with new partners and we will text the results. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit."
    },
